# 🎨 Background Design Tools

A curated collection of useful websites for creating **beautiful, modern, and customizable backgrounds** for websites and UI/UX projects. These tools help developers and designers create gradients, animated backgrounds, SVG shapes, CSS patterns, waves, grids, and abstract designs quickly.

## 🌈 Featured Background Tools

### 1. Super Designer – Animated Mesh Gradient

Create colorful and animated **mesh gradient backgrounds** for modern websites, landing pages, portfolios, and applications. It provides controls for colors, blur, speed, noise, spread, and animation styles.

🔗 https://superdesigner.co/tools/animated-mesh-gradient

### 2. Haikei

Haikei is a generative design tool for creating **SVG and PNG backgrounds**. It offers blobs, waves, gradients, geometric shapes, low-poly designs, peaks, scatter patterns, and more.

🔗 https://app.haikei.app/

### 3. CSS Gradient

CSS Gradient is a simple tool for creating **linear and radial CSS gradients**. You can customize colors, angles, and color stops and copy the generated CSS directly into your project.

🔗 https://cssgradient.io/

### 4. DesignRevision – Background Generator

A multi-purpose background generator for creating **CSS patterns, grids, mesh gradients, and particle effects**. It is useful for HTML/CSS and Tailwind CSS projects.

🔗 https://designrevision.com/tools/background-generator

### 5. MagicPattern – CSS Backgrounds

MagicPattern provides a large collection of **pure CSS background patterns**, including dots, grids, stripes, waves, geometric shapes, checkerboards, and more. Patterns can be customized and copied as CSS.

🔗 https://www.magicpattern.design/tools/css-backgrounds

